## Frequently Asked Questions

### Does LASIK hurt?

No. Numbing drops prevent pain during surgery.

### How long does LASIK last?

LASIK results are usually permanent.

### Can I use mobile phones after LASIK?

Yes, but take regular breaks.

### Will I need glasses again?

Most people don’t need distance glasses again, though reading glasses after 40 may still be needed.

